      "mergeID": "68499a68c375863a17dc5a2a",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Inside the My Avatars tab, I am not able to click on any 'Security Check Failed' avatars leaving it impossible to unfavourite them or view their stats to see why it might've failed. \n\nMy saved public avatars that failed this check are now taking up space in my list that I could use for another avatar, but with this new menu it is impossible to remove them. \n\nThis seems to be an intended feature too, as the message says I am unable to select the avatar. I'm forced to keep them as it is now. \n\nIn the example photo, when I click on a 'Security Check Failed' avatar, it will not allow me to view anything in the inspector on the right, not even an error bot. Because of that, it doesn't give me the option to unfavourite.",
