      "mergeID": "687a5a3c0c326b6dd9603bd8",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When you have an avatar in your favorites list that failed security checks, you cannot select it to unfavorite it, permanently occupying a favorites slot.\n\nSteps:\n\n- Have an avatar in your favorites list (NOT A PERSONAL UPLOADED AVATAR)\n\n- Attempt to select it\n\nExpected: You can at least _select_ the avatar in order to unfavorite it, as you could with the old avatar UI before the 2025 UI update for avatars.\n\nActual: A popup message appears at the bottom of the menu, saying “The security checks on this avatar have failed and it cannot be selected.”",
